  ('home.hero.intro', 'Kia ora! We''re 2 Little Leashes – A dog-crazy whānau who absolutely LOVE spending time with furry friends. Rain or shine, we''re ready with leashes, smiles, treats, and heaps of energy!', 'Hero intro', 'textarea', 'Home – Hero', 150),
